<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">14</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-arsuf"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-arsuf.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Arsuf</span><span class="enc-type">Battle</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Arsuf was fought in 1191 on the coast of Palestine during the Third Crusade, between the Crusader army of Richard I of England and Saladin's forces.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-carrhae"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-carrhae.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Carrhae</span><span class="enc-type">Battle</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Carrhae was fought in 53 BCE near Carrhae (Harran) in upper Mesopotamia.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hazalo"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Hazalo</span><span class="enc-type">Battle</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Hazalo was a defeat suffered by the army of Emir Nur ibn Mujahid of Adal in the period after Imam Ahmad's death.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-khanwa"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-khanwa.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Khanwa</span><span class="enc-type">Battle</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Khanwa was fought in 1527 in northern India between Babur and a Rajput confederacy led by Rana Sanga of Mewar.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ming-sha"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ming Sha</span><span class="enc-type">Battle</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ming Sha was an engagement of the Second Göktürk Khaganate in which a Tang army reported at 80,000 was